--- !u!114 &984521379
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 984521377}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 59e2d407b57e26b4eaead22dc2b97584, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  English_Text: WHEN YOU MAKE TWO OR MORE CUPS IN A ROW, YOU START A STREAK AND ARE
    REWARDED EXTRA COINS.
  French_Text: "LORSQUE VOUS FAITES DEUX TASSES OU PLUS DANS UNE RANG\xC9E, VOUS
    COMMENCEZ UNE S\xC9RIE ET \u200B\u200BVOUS \xCATES R\xC9COMPENS\xC9 DE PI\xC8CES
    SUPPL\xC9MENTAIRES."
  German_Text: "WENN SIE ZWEI ODER MEHR BECHER IN REIHE MACHEN, BEGINNEN SIE EINE
    STREAK UND WERDEN MIT ZUS\xC4TZLICHEN M\xDCNZEN BELOHNT."
  Spanish_Text: "CUANDO HACE DOS O M\xC1S COPAS CONTINUAS, EMPIEZA UNA RACHA Y RECIBE
    MONEDAS ADICIONALES."
  Swedish_Text: "N\xC4R DU G\xD6R TV\xC5 ELLER FLERA KOPPER I RAD, B\xD6RJAR DU EN
    STREAK OCH BEL\xD6NAS EXTRA MYNT."
  Chinese_Simplified_Text: "\u5F53\u60A8\u5236\u4F5C\u4E24\u4E2A\u6216\u66F4\u591A\u676F\u5B50\u65F6\r\n\u8FDE\u7EED\uFF0C\u60A8\u5F00\u59CB\u8FDE\u7EED\r\n\u5E76\u83B7\u5F97\u5956\u52B1\r\n\u989D\u5916\u7684\u786C\u5E01\u3002"
  Hindi_Text: "\u091C\u092C \u0906\u092A \u090F\u0915 \u092A\u0902\u0915\u094D\u0924\u093F
    \u092E\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u094B \u092F\u093E \u0905\u0927\u093F\u0915 \u0915\u092A
    \u092C\u0928\u093E\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0924\u094B \u0906\u092A
    \u090F\u0915 \u0938\u094D\u091F\u094D\u0930\u0940\u0915 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942
    \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092A\u0915\u094B
    \u0905\u0924\u093F\u0930\u093F\u0915\u094D\u0924 \u0938\u093F\u0915\u094D\u0915\u0947
    \u0926\u093F\u090F \u091C\u093E\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
  englishLineSpacing: 0.69
  frenchLineSpacing: 0.96
  germanLineSpacing: 0.74
