--- !u!114 &1694428963
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1694428961}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 59e2d407b57e26b4eaead22dc2b97584, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  English_Text: WHEN YOU PUT YOUR BALL IN A CUP, ALL OF THE CUPS YOU HIT ON THE WAY
    ALSO COUNT.
  French_Text: "LORSQUE VOUS PLACEZ VOTRE BALLE DANS UN TASSE, TOUS LES TASSES QUE
    VOUS AVEZ FRAPP\xC9ES SUR LE CHEMIN COMPTENT \xC9GALEMENT."
  German_Text: "WENN SIE IHREN BALL IN EINEN BECHER LEGEN, Z\xC4HLEN AUCH ALLE BECHER,
    DIE SIE AUF DEM WEG TREFFEN."
  Spanish_Text: "CUANDO METAS TU PELOTA EN UNA COPA, TODAS LAS COPAS QUE GOLPES EN
    EL CAMINO TAMBI\xC9N CUENTAN."
  Swedish_Text: "N\xC4R DU L\xC4TTAR DIN BOLLA I EN BUP R\xC4KNAS OCKS\xC5 ALLA KOPPAR
    DU SL\xC5R P\xC5 V\xC4GEN."
  Chinese_Simplified_Text: "\u5F53\u60A8\u5C06\u7403\u653E\u5165\u676F\u5B50\u4E2D\u65F6\uFF0C\r\n\u60A8\u5728\u9014\u4E2D\u9047\u5230\u7684\u6240\u6709\u676F\u5B50\r\n\u8FD8\u8981\u6570\u3002"
  Hindi_Text: "\u091C\u092C \u0906\u092A \u090F\u0915 \u0915\u092A \u092E\u0947\u0902
    \u0905\u092A\u0928\u0940 \u0917\u0947\u0902\u0926 \u0921\u093E\u0932\u0924\u0947
    \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0924\u094B \u0930\u093E\u0938\u094D\u0924\u0947 \u092E\u0947\u0902
    \u0906\u092A\u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094D\u0935\u093E\u0930\u093E \u092E\u093E\u0930\u093E
    \u0917\u092F\u093E \u0938\u092D\u0940 \u0915\u092A \u092D\u0940 \u0917\u093F\u0928\u093E
    \u091C\u093E\u0924\u093E \u0939\u0948\u0964\r\n"
  englishLineSpacing: 0.71
  frenchLineSpacing: 0.94
  germanLineSpacing: 0.74
  spanishLineSpacing: 0.87
  swedishLineSpacing: 0.84
  chineseSimplifiedLineSpacing: 0.76
  hindiLineSpacing: 0.96
